    "Design 3DIC Compiler AMS Simulation Custom Design Family Digital Design Family FPGA-Based Design Flow Automation Physical Implementation Physical Verification RTL Design and Synthesis Signoff Signal & Power Integrity Test Automation",
    "Signoff Electrical Layout Verification ESP Exalto Formality ECO Formality Equivalence Checking NanoTime PathFinder-SC Power Device WorkBench PrimeClock PrimeClosure PrimeESD PrimeLib PrimePower PrimeShield PrimeTime QuickCap NX RaptorQu RedHawk-SC RedHawk-SC Electrothermal RedHawk-SC Security SiliconSmart StarRC Totem/Totem-SC",
    "Design Signoff",
    "The Trusted, Golden Solution for Leading-Edge Chip Designs",
    "Overview",
    "Key Benefits",
    "What's New",
    "Solutions",
    "Products",
    "Synopsys' design analysis and signoff solution includes a broad portfolio of products for static timing analysis, advanced signal integrity, power and power integrity, parasitic extraction, ECO closure, transistor-level analysis and library characterization, and multiphysics. With an extensive investment in golden signoff solutions, designers can address comprehensive multiphysics challenges, including thermal, electromagnetic, and reliability effects. The native integration of signoff technologies with IC Compiler\u2122 II and Fusion Compiler allows physical designers to confidently realize the full performance-power-area (PPA) potential of the design with the fastest path to design closure.",
    "Synopsys\u2019 PrimeTime\u00ae solution delivers fast, memory-efficient scalar and multicore static timing analysis, distributed multi-scenario analysis and ECO fixing using POCV and variation-aware modeling.",
    "Synopsys PrimeClosure is the industry\u2019s first AI-driven golden signoff ECO closure solution and is integrated with industry-golden Synopsys PrimeTime Static Timing Analysis and Synopsys Fusion Compiler\u2122 RTL-to-GDSII implementation solution to accelerate electronic-design power-performance-area closure time-to-results (TTR).",
    "Synopsys PrimeShield solution provides the industry\u2019s fastest design robustness analysis solution built on golden PrimeTime STA and accelerated with breakthrough machine learning technology.",
    "Synopsys PrimeClock, the latest innovation in the PrimeTime family, is purpose-built to scientifically analyze and optimize clock jitter and structural integrity in 2GHz\u20135GHz designs, helping teams recover critical performance margin to improve performance and yield.",
    "Synopsys NanoTime is the golden timing signoff solution for transistor-level design for CPU datapaths, embedded memories and complex AMS IP blocks.",
    "Its seamless integration with Synopsys\u2019 PrimeTime\u00ae product enables full-chip analysis of designs that includes both gate- and transistor-level blocks. Synopsys NanoTime is a key component of the Synopsys custom design verification solution that includes Synopsys CustomSim\u00ae and HSPICE for circuit simulation and Synopsys ESP for symbolic simulation-based equivalence checking.",
    "Synopsys Totem and Totem-SC is a transistor-level power integrity platform for voltage-drop (IR drop) and electromigration (EM) signoff of analog mixed-signal (AMS) IP and full-custom designs.",
    "Synopsys PrimePower analyzes power dissipation for block and full-chip designs starting from RTL, through implementation, and leading to power signoff.",
    "Synopsys RedHawk-SC is the industry\u2019s trusted gold standard voltage-drop (IR-drop) and electromigration (EM) multiphysics sign-off solution for digital designs.\u200b",
    "Synopsys PathFinder-SC is a high-capacity signoff platform for verifying theprotective circuitry found on all chips that protect them from electrostaticdischarge (ESD) and damage from voltage spikes.",
    "The Synopsys SiliconSmart\u00ae solution provides fast, accurate, and advanced node proven library characterization for standard cells, I/O and memory. Synopsys PrimeLib is the next-generation, unified library characterization and validation solution, providing ultra-fast, signoff-quality libraries and is optimized for scaling and performance for cloud and cluster computing workloads.",
    "Synopsys SiliconSmart and Synopsys PrimeLib innovative technologies utilize embedded gold-reference SPICE engines to provide a characterization speed-up of advanced Liberty models used by Synopsys PrimeTime static timing analysis to accurately account for effects seen in ultra-low-voltage FinFET processes that impact timing.",
    "The Synopsys StarRC\u2122 solution provides golden signoff parasitic extraction for silicon accurate results supporting advanced foundry nodes and design flows.\u200b",
    "The Synopsys QuickCap\u00ae NX solution is the golden extraction reference tool for advanced node process modeling and high accuracy library characterization.",
    "Synopsys VeloceRF provides an inductive device synthesis and modeling tool for custom inductors, transformers, baluns, and transmission lines. \u200b",
    "Synopsys Exalto enables accurate modeling of electromagnetic coupling and capture electromagnetic crosstalk during the signoff phase on circuits that were previously considered too big to analyze.",
    "Synopsys ParagonX and PrimeX addresses the increasing impact of layout parasitics on performance, accuracy, power, robustness, and reliability, for analog and mixed-signal designs.\u200b",
    "Synopsys PowerX provides intelligent analysis and visualization for PowerFETs and PowerManagement ICs (PMICs)\u200b",
    "Synopsys RaptorQu delivers silicon-optimized electromagnetic modeling for quantum and cryogenic computing.",
    "Synopsys RedHawk-SC Security performs a pre-silicon assessment to measure side-channel vulnerabilities and assess the most effective design countermeasures.",
    "Synopsys RedHawk-SC Electrothermal is a multiphysics simulation platform for 2.5/3D-ICs, interposers, chiplets, and multi-die packages. Based on Synopsys golden solvers, it analyzes thermal integrity (TI), power integrity (PI), electromagnetic signal integrity (SI), electromagnetic coupling (EMC), and thermomechanical structural integrity.",
